    "catalog:lod": "300",
    "catalog:tags": "wheelchair, accessibility, clearance",
    "catalog:note": "Manual wheelchair for testing transfer and manoeuvring space by eye, front to +z. seat 0.50. Wheels and castors are solid discs; the frame is drawn with upright and level members, since tilted parts are unverified. The plan is the two wheels and the frame with its footplates, and the seat-back line. The plan leaves out the axle between the frame and the wheels.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Wheelchair 0.70 x 1.20 x 1.10, seat 0.50: generic practice size, not checked against BS 8300-2 or ISO 7176-5 (unverified)",
